{"content":"// Wake-launcher tests for `agent_cli_inbox.dart`, split out of
// `agent_cli_test.dart` (gh-1744 review): that suite sat 2 lines under the
// repo's 2800-line god-file ceiling on main, and the launchMailboxWake
// group pushed it over. Both groups exercise only public API
